description = "[PAWN_nameDef] never figured out what to do with [PAWN_possessive] life. [PAWN_pronoun] traveled often, taking up casual work wherever [PAWN_pronoun] found it.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] also occasionally worked on a novel that [PAWN_pronoun] knew would be a bestseller - just as soon as [PAWN_pronoun] could find a publisher who was interested."
